  "pricingText": "For every second of video you generate, you will be charged **$0.068** at **480p**, **$0.14** at **720p**, or **$0.28** at **1080p**. For example, a **5s** video at **720p** will cost **$0.70**. **Pricing is subject to change.**\n\nFor more details, see [fal.ai pricing](https://fal.ai/pricing)."
